## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
  input x content integer
  output o content integer

scope A:
  definition o equals
    if x > 0 then 1
    else
      if x = 0 then
        2
      else
        if x < 0 then
          3
        else -1
```

Note that `-1` is never reached.

```catala-test-cli
$ catala DCalc -s A -O
let scope A (A_in: A_in): A =
  let get x : integer = A_in.x_in in
  let set o : integer =
    if x > 0 then 1 else if x = 0 then 2 else if x < 0 then 3 else -1
  in
  return { A o = o; }
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala Concolic --conc-optim=incremental -s A
┌─[RESULT]─ Concolic execution ─
│ Executed 3 tests:
│     Inputs │ Outputs
│ ────── Test #1 ────
│ x_in = 0   │ o = 2
│ ────── Test #2 ────
│ x_in = -1  │ o = 3
│ ────── Test #3 ────
│ x_in = 1   │ o = 1
└─
```
